      <statement><p>Estimate <m>\int_0^{4}x^{2}\, dx</m> using SIMP(4).</p>
<p><m>\int_0^{4}x^{2}\, dx \approx</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
      <answer>
        <p>
          <m>\frac{2\cdot 20+24}{3}</m>
        </p>
      </answer>
      <solution><m>= 2(0 + 2^{2}) = 8</m> and
RIGHT(2) <m>= 2(2^{2} + 4^{2}) = 40</m>, so
TRAP(2) <m>= 24</m>.



Then
MID(2) <m>= 2( (1)^{2} + (3)^{2} ) = 20</m>.



Thus,
<me>\mbox{SIMP(4)} = {{2\mbox{MID(2)} + \mbox{TRAP(2)}} \over 3} =
    21.3333.</me>



</solution>
